  "edits": [
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00002",
      "source_hash": "773304ef708d8f0d93c79adfc6b7923dd7e1d871d2c5e6b50bc5ad71edf91859",
      "target_id": "XML:2703376",
      "text": "行政罚款的征收标准（与第六十三条相关）"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00003",
      "source_hash": "a617cf3ccc65ba6af0228b05b78c02b61364dbd74e669da8ea55dab0e5a320b6",
      "target_id": "XML:2703377",
      "text": "1. 一般标准"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00004",
      "source_hash": "7ac7ffb007933777d2a6f3c82b350b4e248f0a52470bb6500c70c0c7fdfcd6ab",
      "target_id": "XML:2703378",
      "text": "甲. 按违法次数加重征收行政罚款的标准，适用于最近三年内因同一"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00005",
      "source_hash": "231d79f07f8eb08c2a5a982f812e7f6abc2df1f47d7ee622f3b85a14dac4e471",
      "target_id": "XML:2703379",
      "text": "违法行为受到行政罚款处分的情形。期间的计算以"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00006",
      "source_hash": "632f3d91f925bbd12880045a976c1e52c57609d706e49a7869ed050955c3e0f4",
      "target_id": "XML:2703380",
      "text": "对该违法行为作出行政罚款处分之日，以及该处分后再次实施同一"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00007",
      "source_hash": "8124c54590e8d32b809acc109df8750a4cbce3daccee548b10f245584ce305d5",
      "target_id": "XML:2703381",
      "text": "违法行为而被查获之日为基准。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00008",
      "source_hash": "28427a9884ed513dd4321efe166cf34c52bfab835193a1e9c6d06ad75605857e",
      "target_id": "XML:2703382",
      "text": "乙. 按甲目加重征收行政罚款时，加重处分的适用次数为该违法行为之前"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00009",
      "source_hash": "80af16944b3f4321139c5e04366f9972d17dea5d57271149f14aa8862b977e6f",
      "target_id": "XML:2703383",
      "text": "的处分次数（甲目规定的期间内受到两次以上行政罚款处分时，"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00010",
      "source_hash": "3a1004e8ef673dc82c59b8deff719e4bf3a48af05a231e160d618998d658bad0",
      "target_id": "XML:2703384",
      "text": "按其中较高的次数计算）的下一次数。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00011",
      "source_hash": "137f431f7f0b43dd01f2bc57404e02a638dda5a8d20d24933cc43f13b3bf8728",
      "target_id": "XML:2703385",
      "text": "丙. 属于下列任一情形时，征收机关可以依第二号规定的个别标准"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00012",
      "source_hash": "e4d51e535282cbade32731c06483f908756d3f4210bb1f27808382bc07c29f32",
      "target_id": "XML:2703386",
      "text": "减轻或者免除行政罚款。但拖欠行政罚款的"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00013",
      "source_hash": "609148ed69f60385a982b63100860dffd0371e452359d68740e7fba36fcda585",
      "target_id": "XML:2703387",
      "text": "违法行为人不适用减免。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00016",
      "source_hash": "51f12bd424c332d84c50ee5ea00ec4ef295dcf0eecf6f64a31c9460e2f20e2be",
      "target_id": "XML:2703390",
      "text": "3）违法行为人属于《中小企业基本法》第二条规定的中小企业等，"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00017",
      "source_hash": "b406a346139ac17abd0f08d3744e7a4c07bec7a5ddda75f97c071621436af3be",
      "target_id": "XML:2703391",
      "text": "认定其罚款相对于业务类型和规模过重的情形"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00018",
      "source_hash": "b61facf485043cb680048d74ce38ab620ec1f568a59c0f9b0a7ca930b97ad9e7",
      "target_id": "XML:2703392",
      "text": "4）违法行为人为纠正或消除违法状态作出努力并"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00019",
      "source_hash": "e1831b5da0f7207ef6aaa819bdb0899ca549273f22c0634020e633702944b1a1",
      "target_id": "XML:2703393",
      "text": "获得认可的情形"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00020",
      "source_hash": "a36677387529a4646617f25226a014e5fff7ba73a1c430295d67a9ddaaf686c8",
      "target_id": "XML:2703394",
      "text": "5）违法行为人已采取恢复违法行为所致损害及防止损害扩大的"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00021",
      "source_hash": "506529bdcf81464187907b0cd83a54c86d628c134047c537fa16894ee3412567",
      "target_id": "XML:2703395",
      "text": "措施的情形"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00022",
      "source_hash": "1c8c3c98791cf81c753becc822031a80ada7908c9df96ffc9a43d3c9fd3c64b7",
      "target_id": "XML:2703396",
      "text": "6）违法行为人依照本法第三十二条之二取得个人信息保护认证，或从事自主"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00023",
      "source_hash": "7d44454ba8915dc5b20ee8f1fce721c93a7eebc279a86e7e42190bfeec330f57",
      "target_id": "XML:2703397",
      "text": "保护活动等为保护个人信息所作努力获得认可的情形"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00024",
      "source_hash": "4726d4242bb07f0e2a1adf9d81b97545db64e02b2be71dbe4d33b3959ce6c3d1",
      "target_id": "XML:2703399",
      "text": "7）违法行为人主动申报违法事实的情形"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00025",
      "source_hash": "597fe8efff38c67a14c80af2a9a1e4557273d3ddf492c417e6154b149c796c68",
      "target_id": "XML:2703400",
      "text": "8）其他综合考虑违法行为程度、动机及其结果等，认为有必要减轻"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00026",
      "source_hash": "5bf1247fe41c3ddd04bc6b51092ba438ef9d3b215c5aac6a3ce35a89aac8137a",
      "target_id": "XML:2703401",
      "text": "或免除行政罚款的情形"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00027",
      "source_hash": "50bf9c09c58511dcacdcd5bff3ade66c8db8419bd20ba1f7b4830d2e12699da4",
      "target_id": "XML:2703402",
      "text": "丁. 属于下列任一情形时，征收机关可以依第二号规定的个别标准，"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00028",
      "source_hash": "72dec13d8bdde5d73da0d70b8142c7fce07589675505347ace9ffa1b33fb7150",
      "target_id": "XML:2703403",
      "text": "在其行政罚款金额二分之一的范围内加重征收。但加重征收时，"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00029",
      "source_hash": "e4f08a152a5474fdab43a8a4e89b53f815d91d0cfc0ec5ec778653192f289615",
      "target_id": "XML:2703404",
      "text": "也不得超过本法第七十五条第一款至第四款规定的行政罚款金额"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00030",
      "source_hash": "aee7cda955ff930bc828c440d5e0839e4a440ac92132db31fa4c8720eff4c8b1",
      "target_id": "XML:2703405",
      "text": "上限。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00031",
      "source_hash": "2b59f50c69cab30a15a87dab7afe012b5bba5cbbae683dad5865aaa8483b2959",
      "target_id": "XML:2703406",
      "text": "1）违法内容及程度严重，认定对信息主体等造成重大损害的"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00032",
      "source_hash": "e1831b5da0f7207ef6aaa819bdb0899ca549273f22c0634020e633702944b1a1",
      "target_id": "XML:2703407",
      "text": "情形"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00033",
      "source_hash": "6d280d72f7ab7185a3708e26bdf3b9db2dca989aadbb523994789cb848e1c7b9",
      "target_id": "XML:2703408",
      "text": "2）其他综合考虑违法行为的程度、持续期间、动机及其结果等，"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00034",
      "source_hash": "227c329a7e963f207705050e360c8e644a200243fa0bed5f048e3068ad83cb6f",
      "target_id": "XML:2703409",
      "text": "认定有必要加重行政罚款金额的情形"
    }
  ],
  "note": "A37057 Korean original first 34 rows checked: 3y recidivism, escalation tier, eight mitigation conditions, 1/2 maximum aggravation and legal cap. Original penalties and source hashes preserved; annex remains partial."
}
